  {
    "heading": "OUR SERVICES",
    "description": "<p>From identifying the right opportunities to understanding market potential and investment considerations, we offer guidance at every step. With a client-first approach and strong industry knowledge, our team makes the real estate journey more informed, transparent, and seamless.</p>",
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "heading": "FOR BUYERS",
    "description": "<p>At Mulyam, our focus is to make every step seamless, transparent, and rewarding for our buyers by doing the following:</p><ul><li>Free, end-to-end assistance for a seamless home-buying journey</li><li>Curated property search based on budget, location, and preferences</li><li>Site visit coordination with guided project walkthroughs</li><li>Expert advice backed by market insights and pricing trends</li><li>Negotiation support to secure the best deals and offers</li><li>Assistance with documentation, legal processes, and home loans</li><li>Post-sales support including coordination and possession assistance</li><li>Access to exclusive deals through strong developer relationships</li></ul><p>We act as trusted advisors, ensuring a transparent, efficient, and rewarding home-buying experience from search to possession.</p>",
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "heading": "FOR INVESTORS",
    "description": "<p>Our approach is focused on simplifying acquisition while maximizing long-term value and returns. We help investors by providing:</p><ul><li>Market insights and advisory to identify high-growth, investment-worthy opportunities</li><li>Property selection with curated options and site visit coordination</li><li>Expert evaluation of layouts, amenities, and return potential</li><li>Negotiation support to secure optimal pricing and flexible terms</li><li>Due diligence including legal checks, RERA compliance, and risk assessment</li><li>Financial guidance covering loan processes, payment structures, and ROI planning</li><li>End-to-end support through documentation, closing, and post-purchase coordination</li></ul><p>We act as trusted investment advisors, ensuring a transparent, efficient, and value-driven investment experience.</p>",
    "isActive": true
  },
  {
    "heading": "FOR DEVELOPERS",
    "description": "<p>At Mulyam, we act as an extended sales and marketing partner, enabling developers to accelerate sales and expand market reach. We help developers in the following ways:</p><ul><li>Strategic marketing and promotion through targeted campaigns and qualified lead generation</li><li>Sales acceleration with end-to-end management, from inquiries to site visits and deal closure</li><li>Market intelligence and feedback on buyer preferences and emerging trends</li><li>CRM-driven management of the entire buyer journey, from lead to booking and documentation</li><li>Expanded reach across wider audiences, including NRIs and institutional investors</li><li>Inventory support and underwriting to enhance liquidity when required</li></ul><p>We operate as specialized sales teams, driving faster closures and improving overall sales efficiency.</p>",
    "isActive": true
  }
]

